:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:HELP NAME=STRSEU.Start Source Entry Utility (STRSEU)
:P.Use the Start Source Entry Utility (STRSEU) command to edit, browse
or print a source member with SEU.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSEU/SRCFILE'.Source file (SRCFILE)
:P.The source physical file that holds the source member, by name and
library.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*PRV:EPK.
:PD.The previous release.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSEU/SRCMBR'.Source member (SRCMBR)
:P.The member of the source file that holds the source. *PGM, *MODULE or
*CMD and the like mean the member with the same name as the object being
created.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*PRV:EPK.
:PD.The previous release.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SELECT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSEU/TYPE'.Source type (TYPE)
:P.The source type for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSEU/OPTION'.Option (OPTION)
:P.The option for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.Blanks&colon. no value.
:EPARML.
:P.The value must be '2', '5', '6'.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRSEU/TEXT'.Text 'description' (TEXT)
:P.A short description of the object, up to 50 characters, shown by the
work-with and display commands next to its name.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.No text.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 50 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
